#: ../../source/tutorials/sqd-showcase.md:242
msgid ""
"Preserve the complete `SQDResult` or its serialized `sqd.result.v1` object. An energy without its"
" method, tier, active space, frame, Hamiltonian, units, and uncertainty semantics is not an "
"auditable result."
msgstr "保留完整 `SQDResult` 或其序列化 `sqd.result.v1` 对象。没有方法、层级、活性空间、轨道框架、哈密顿量、单位和不确定性含义的能量，不能作为可审计结果。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/sqd-showcase.md:246
msgid "Resource failures and reference-only runs"
msgstr "资源失败与仅参考运行"

#: ../../source/tutorials/sqd-showcase.md:248
msgid ""
"`ReferenceConfig` sets one shared wall deadline and decimal-MB RSS budget. The executor uses the "
"lowest limit: the user budget, currently available host memory, or the 8192 MB hard component "
"cap. Predictions at a cap reject before allocation. The supervisor terminates the run when "
"observed process-tree RSS reaches a cap. `allow_large=True` can cross only a soft policy boundary"
" and cannot bypass the calibrated domain, host availability, or hard caps."
msgstr ""
"`ReferenceConfig` 设置统一的实际时间截止点和十进制 MB RSS 预算。执行器取用户预算、当前主机可用内存及 8192 MB "
"组件硬上限中的最低值。预测值达到上限时，会在分配前拒绝。观测进程树 RSS 达到上限时，监督执行器终止运行。`allow_large=True` "
"只能跨越软策略边界，不能绕过校准域、主机可用量或硬上限。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/sqd-showcase.md:255
msgid ""
"For an intentional baseline without sampling, pass `mode=\"reference_only\"`. The result records "
"absent sampling fields and their reasons. A failed full run never silently becomes reference-only"
" or substitutes HF for SQD."
msgstr "需要有意仅计算基准而不采样时，传入 `mode=\"reference_only\"`。结果记录缺失采样字段及原因。失败的完整运行不会静默变成仅参考运行，也不会用 HF 替代 SQD。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/sqd-showcase.md:259
msgid ""
"See [SQD guide](../sqd.md) for the reference ladder, full 40-field result contract, calibrated "
"domain, measured outcomes, and research-status boundaries. The checkout guides "
"`examples/sqd/README.md` and `examples/qmmm/README.md` document the public workflow. Local "
"development tools are not required in a fresh clone."
msgstr ""
"参考阶梯、完整 40 字段结果契约、校准域、实测结果和研究状态边界见 [SQD 指南](../sqd.md)。源码仓库指南 `examples/sqd/README.md` 和 "
"`examples/qmmm/README.md` 说明公开工作流。新克隆仓库不要求本地开发工具。"
